<title>USA: ING Barings names Marron to LatAm equities team.</title>
<headline>ING Barings names Marron to LatAm equities team.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Maria Marron has joined ING Barings' equity team as head of research for the food and beverage and media sectors, Barings said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>In a statement, Barings said Marron would be based in New York. She joins Barings from Salomon Brothers, where she was a senior analyst covering the Latin American food and beverage and media industries.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
